{
  "_comment": [
    "Golden-render regression cases for mw808 (tests/golden/CMakeLists.txt registers one CTest per case,",
    "label 'golden'). Each case is a command line for tools/mw808-render; the harness appends --out.",
    "  id        : unique; the blessed render is blessed/<id>.wav",
    "  args      : mw808-render arguments; @GOLDEN_DIR@ expands to this directory",
    "  reference : optional id of another case whose blessed file this render must match (no file of its own)",
    "  tol       : optional mw808-wavcompare tolerance (absolute, or lsb:<n>); default one LSB of the file",
    "  note      : what the case covers",
    "Patterns come from patterns/*.txt and use --kit stock, so nothing here depends on the factory library.",
    "Re-bless after an intended sound change: BLESS_REASON='why' tools/bless_goldens.sh <build-dir>"
  ],
